{"title": "Vampire Regeneration", "pageid": 19270, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vampire_Regeneration", "categories": ["Passive features", "Toggleable passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Regeneration.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Regeneration.webp/300px-Regeneration.webp, /w/images/4/46/Regeneration.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Regeneration.webp/300px-Regeneration.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Regeneration.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Vampire Regeneration</b> is a passive feature that allows a <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire\" title=\"Vampire\">Vampire</a> to regenerate 10 hit points at the start of its turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The vampire regains <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> at the start of its turn if it isn't in sunlight, or has taken <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage or damage from <a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Water\" title=\"Holy Water\">Holy Water</a>, in which case this trait doesn't function until the start of its next turn. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Vampire_Regeneration\"> Condition: Vampire Regeneration </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Regeneration_(Condition)\" title=\"Vampire Regeneration (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp/30px-Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp/45px-Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp/60px-Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampire Regeneration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp/30px-Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Animalistic_Vitality_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Regeneration_(Condition)\" title=\"Vampire Regeneration (Condition)\">Vampire Regeneration</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The vampire regains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"20 hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a> at the start of its turn, unless it is in sunlight, or has taken radiant damage or damage from holy water.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Andrik\" title=\"Andrik\">Andrik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Antwun_Dufay\" title=\"Antwun Dufay\">Antwun Dufay</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aurelia\" title=\"Aurelia\">Aurelia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chessa\" title=\"Chessa\">Chessa</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dalyria\" title=\"Dalyria\">Dalyria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gondlemead\" title=\"Gondlemead\">Gondlemead</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hapdim\" title=\"Hapdim\">Hapdim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kass\" title=\"Kass\">Kass</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Leon\" title=\"Leon\">Leon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Misha\" title=\"Misha\">Misha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Petras\" title=\"Petras\">Petras</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sebastian\" title=\"Sebastian\">Sebastian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vanja\" title=\"Vanja\">Vanja</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Violet\" title=\"Violet\">Violet</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wensleydale\" title=\"Wensleydale\">Wensleydale</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yousen\" title=\"Yousen\">Yousen</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Heals 10 <a href=\"/wiki/HP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"HP\">HP</a> per turn, unless under sunlight or recently taken <a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\">radiant</a> damage.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203400\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1394/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12746/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4902/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1000/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 752290/52428800 b